Z||000000||RobertVol||03-25-2001||03:57 PM||||Had a great time at the Daytona meeting this year. <P>Phil...loved your car<BR>Doug ...nice meeting ya for real!! and dont forget our subwoofer conversation <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Glen uh what happened? I owe ya 10!<P>Met Ed parks ...great guy. got some good info from him.....<P>Will have pics posted on our website by the evening tonight !!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>A few of the pics that will be featured....<P>Northstars<BR>T tops<BR>Kit Cars (Diablos, Countach, Archies Finale)<P>and everything else ! <P>Should have done by 7:00 pm EST<P><P>------------------<BR>Robert<BR>88GT 56k T TOP  <BR>North Florida Fiero Club <A HREF="http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros" TARGET=_blank>http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros</A><BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=819451&a=5959473&p=36934984&Sequence=1"> ||||reg||14
Z||000001||87GT||03-25-2001||05:00 PM||||Hey Robert.  I saw your car and thought it was very nice.  I happened to listen to the judges when they were at your car.  They got you on the driver door being closed.  I dont know if you knew or not, but the driver door and the gas cap were suppose to be open.  I didnt know that until I got the show and a judge sitting next to me told me that.  My gas cap area was kinda nasty but I got it cleaned up in time.  The SCMC class I was in was very rough. 22 cars to be exact.  I knew I was in trouble when I saw some big time show car people getting out old tooth brushes, and Q-tips to clean their cracks and small hard to reach areas.  Oh well, I had fun!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  ||||reg||1
Z||000002||RobertVol||03-25-2001||07:39 PM||||Huh! Did not know that! but uh Thanks for the tip. Next time I will be prepared. I entered for the fun of it !! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Had a great time! <P>I saw you car also..looked nice ! <P>------------------<BR>Robert<BR>88GT 56k T TOP  <BR>North Florida Fiero Club <A HREF="http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros" TARGET=_blank>http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros</A><BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=819451&a=5959473&p=36934984&Sequence=1"> ||||reg||14
